translation:
{cmd:7F090000FF}I've always thought
a guy needs{cmd:7F0306}
some adventure in his life!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}The quickest adventure{cmd:7F0308}
is to{cmd:7F0304} leave familiar ground
behind,{cmd:7F0306} right?{cmd:7F0304}
{cmd:7F1A}-{cmd:7F504B5F9B02}--?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}You agree, don't you?{cmd:7F0306}
Then go visit
another town!{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}Meeting new people{cmd:7F0304}
in places you've never seen!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Oh, YEAH!!{cmd:7F0308}
That's a man's romance
right there! {cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}To leave {cmd:7F2F}{cmd:7F0306}
and set out on an adventure,{cmd:7F04}
head to the {cmd:7F504BA00007}station{cmd:7F0304} and
hop on a train! {cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}BUT!{cmd:7F0308}
Without a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,
you{cmd:7F0304} can't board the train!
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}Don't forget your
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak!{cmd:7F0308}
It's essential for travel,
{cmd:7F1A}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Hey,{cmd:7F0304} do you have any friends{cmd:7F0306}
who live in another town,
{cmd:7F0900000B}not this one?{cmd:7F030A}
{cmd:7F1C}?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}If you do,{cmd:7F0308}
you could go{cmd:7F0304}
barge into their town...{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Or{cmd:7F0306} have them
come visit you here{cmd:7F0304}
instead! Sounds fun!{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Your world's not{cmd:7F0304}
going to get much bigger{cmd:7F0306}
if you stay put{cmd:7F0304}
in one town,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}If you want to
visit another town,{cmd:7F0306}
go to the {cmd:7F504BA00007}station{cmd:7F0304}
and catch a train.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}To ride that train,{cmd:7F0304}
you need something called
a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000016}
{cmd:7F02}Don't you forget it!{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Have you heard the saying,
"A frog in a well
knows nothing of the sea"{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F0304}?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}It means{cmd:7F0304} acting superior,
as if you know everything
about the world{cmd:7F0304}...{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}When really,{cmd:7F0304}
you're just{cmd:7F0304} a country bumpkin
who knows nothing,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}You should take a chance{cmd:7F0304}
to leave {cmd:7F2F}{cmd:7F0306}
and see the world outside,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}If you think everywhere
is just the same,{cmd:7F0306}
you're very much mistaken!{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}To go beyond
{cmd:7F2F},{cmd:7F0308}
take a trip
on the train.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}For that, you need
a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,
but{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F0900000B}{cmd:7F0303} did you know that?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}Hee hee.{cmd:7F0308}
You made it to this town,
so you must know that much,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}
